tlin	!07a1y	!072	!Enter x if, at any time during 2022, you had a financial interest in or signature authority over a financial account located in a foreign country.
.lin	!07a1n	!073	!Enter x if you did not had such financial interest or signature authority.
tlin	!07a2y	!074	!Enter x if your are required to file FinCEN Form114.
tlin	!07a2n	!075	!Enter x if your are not so required.
tlin	!07b	!076	!If you are required to file FinCEN form 114, list the name(s) of the foreign country(ies) where the financial account(s) are located.
tlin	!08y	!077	!Enter x if , during 2022, you received a distribution from, or were the grantor of, or transferor to , a foreign trust. If yes, you may have to file Form 3520.
tlin	!08n	!078	!Enter x if you were not such a receiver, grantor, or transferor.
